+# T59 Result
+
+## Files created/modified
+
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/verify_explain_memory.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/list_memory_conflicts.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/verify_explain_tests.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/admin_tools_tests.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/mod.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs`
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/memory/store.rs`
+
+## Verification commands and outputs
+
+- Command: `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/verify_explain_memory.rs && echo OK`
+  - Output: `OK`
+
+- Command: `test -f daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/list_memory_conflicts.rs && echo OK`
+  - Output: `OK`
+
+- Command: `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-daemon --lib rpc::memory_v2::verify_explain_tests`
+  - Output:
+    - `Finished test profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.36s`
+    - `running 7 tests`
+    - `7 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 82 filtered out`
+    - Result: `ok`
+  - Notes:
+    - The command emitted existing compiler warnings in unrelated areas and some dead-code warnings in the crate, but the required test target passed cleanly.
+
+## Issues encountered
+
+- `MemoryStore::store` had a real SQL defect: the `memories` `INSERT OR REPLACE` statement declared 37 columns but only supplied 36 values. This blocked memory creation in tests and had to be fixed in-scope.
+- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/memory_v2/mod.rs` already referenced `admin_tools_tests`, but no backing file existed. A real test module file was added so the target compiles correctly.
+- Existing lower-level helper code in `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/mcp.rs` required the correct imports and integration wiring to compile once the new memory-v2 tools were registered.
+
+## Final status
+
+`complete`

